{
  "title": "Swing\u2013stance correlation contains no information beyond complete marginal gait variances: an exploratory cross-collection audit",
  "abstract": "Same-stride swing\u2013stance correlation is algebraically determined by per-foot stride, swing and stance variances. Empirical identity error was below1.9e-15 in two public gait collections. Incremental Parkinson/control prediction was inconclusive (target delta logloss -0.003144, joint95%CI [-0.044685,0.060523]); no new independent physiological information or clinical utility is established.",
